<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boise Cascade downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boise Cascade downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it lowered its rating on Boise Cascade Corp to market perform from trading buy.</p>
<p>-- In midmorning New York Stock Exchange trade, the stock was off 1-3/4 to 31-1/2, approaching a year-low 30-1/8.</p>
</text>
